  "instructions": [
    "Whisk together flour, baking powder, cumin, coriander, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Slowly pour low‑fat milk into the dry mix while stirring until a smooth batter forms.",
    "Heat a nonstick skillet over medium heat and lightly coat with olive oil spray.",
    "Drop spoonfuls of batter into the skillet, flattening them to about 2‑3 cm thick.",
    "Fry each fritter for 2‑3 minutes per side until golden brown and crisp.",
    "Transfer cooked fritters to a paper‑towel‑lined plate to drain excess oil.",
    "Serve immediately with a squeeze of lemon or a light yogurt dip."
